# Allowlist: the build context contains only what the image needs. Anything
# new in the repository (tests, docs, local .env files, bot_data, CSV
# statements, databases) stays out unless it is added here on purpose.
*
!requirements.txt
!ynab_helper/**
!revolut_to_ynab.py
!revolut_ynab_bot.py

# Re-exclude build and editor debris, and anything that could hold secrets or
# financial data, even if it ends up inside the package directory by accident.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/*.env
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.csv
**/*.log
